Vnum            12212
Name            裂魄粒界座~
Description
粒界座像整段粒界深井最後一塊仍勉強聚得住輪廓的聚粒石座，腳下環界只剩一圈隨時會再碎末一層的細薄紋，所有殘痕都在這裡被拖往更深的裂魄末界。
~
SectorType      SECT_INSIDE

#Exit
Direction       UP
ExitVnum        12211
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Exit
Direction       DOWN
ExitVnum        12301
ExitDesc        ~
ExitKeyword     ~
ExitKey         0
End

#Enquire
Keyword         粒界座~
End

#Enquire
Keyword         深處~
End

End
